{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.poster.avif?t=1759758467\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.webm?t=1759758467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.mp4?t=1759758467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bit Buddy</strong> reacts in real-time to your keyboard and mouse activity. Every click and movement brings an adorable response from your little companion. Even better, each interaction gives you a chance to unlock new decorations, with no extra effort required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>600+ unique accessories and pet skins</strong> to collect and customize, you can give your Bit Buddy a one-of-a-kind look that matches your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Buddy automatically logs your daily and historical keyboard and mouse activity, so you can easily track how much you\u2019ve typed or clicked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're working or studying, <strong>Bit Buddy</strong> stays by your side on your screen\u2014your loyal digital coworker, always there with you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874950?t=1759758467","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/53a37308f3e466fa81cb16752037c3b528c1177b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759758467","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/63acb7f078c497ba918be85e903c6511eec7b54b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759758467","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/63acb7f078c497ba918be85e903c6511eec7b54b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759758467","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3950450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.poster.avif?t=1759758467\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.webm?t=1759758467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.mp4?t=1759758467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bit Buddy</strong> reacts in real-time to your keyboard and mouse activity. Every click and movement brings an adorable response from your little companion. Even better, each interaction gives you a chance to unlock new decorations, with no extra effort required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>600+ unique accessories and pet skins</strong> to collect and customize, you can give your Bit Buddy a one-of-a-kind look that matches your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Buddy automatically logs your daily and historical keyboard and mouse activity, so you can easily track how much you\u2019ve typed or clicked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"b